# work-item-template-field-hints.sh golden file.
# Format: <field>|<template state>|<exit_code>|<expected output, one value per line, \n-encoded>
#
# <template state>:
#   comment-present     — real `templates/work-item.md` (via `accelerator
#                         config template work-item`), field line has a
#                         trailing `# a | b | c` comment
#   comment-absent      — field line present but with no trailing `#`
#                         comment (falls back to hardcoded_fallback)
#   template-unreadable — the `accelerator config template work-item`
#                         command itself fails (falls back to
#                         hardcoded_fallback identically to comment-absent
#                         per work-item-template-field-hints.sh:52-56;
#                         same code path, not separately exercised against
#                         a real broken template at capture time)
#
# hardcoded_fallback is empty for any field other than kind/status/priority.
#
# Cross-checked against a real invocation of the real
# templates/work-item.md at implementation time.

kind|comment-present|0|story\nepic\ntask\nbug\nspike
status|comment-present|0|draft\nready\nin-progress\nreview\ndone\nblocked\nabandoned
priority|comment-present|0|high\nmedium\nlow
title|comment-absent|0|(empty)
kind|template-unreadable|0|story\nepic\ntask\nbug\nspike
status|template-unreadable|0|draft\nready\nin-progress\nreview\ndone\nblocked\nabandoned
priority|template-unreadable|0|high\nmedium\nlow

[USAGE_ERROR]
(no args)|1|Usage: work-item-template-field-hints.sh <field>
